  "ruleText": "Rev 505.03 Excavation on Public Lands. An excavation area conducted upon public lands shall be assessed pursuant to RSA 72:23, I(b).\n\nSource. #7381, eff 10-24-00; ss by #7860, eff 3-31-03, EXPIRED: 3-31-11\n\nNew. #9926, eff 5-18-11 (from Rev 506.02); ss by #12834, eff 7-25-19",
